# Artifacts

Canonical paths (create dirs if missing):

| Kind | Path |
|------|------|
| Research | `artifacts/research/<slug>.md` |
| Spec | `artifacts/specs/<slug>.md` |
| Plan | `artifacts/plans/<slug>.md` |
| Wayfinder | `artifacts/plans/<slug>-wayfinder.md` |
| Tickets | `artifacts/tickets/<slug>.md` |
| Review | `artifacts/reviews/<slug>.md` |
| Handoff | `artifacts/handoffs/<slug>.md` |
| Teach | `artifacts/teach/<topic-slug>/` |
| ADR | `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md` |

Use templates in `templates/` when starting a new file.

Slug = kebab-case, stable for the task (reuse across phases).

When continuing prior work, **read** the existing artifacts before asking the user to restate requirements.
